  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil for the ravioli. Finely chop the onion. Crush or finely chop the garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2919298/photos/large/65511_1-3b43ced7ea8afb390163136ba096d54f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook ravioli: Cook the ravioli in the pan of boiling water for 3 mins or until al dente. Reserve 60ml (¼ cup) cooking water, then drain the ravioli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2919299/photos/large/65511_2-e76a880bee0fc8755652f4ec63568c97.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start sauce: Heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium deep frypan over medium-high heat. Cook the onion and garlic, stirring, for 2-3 mins until softened. Stir in half the tomatoes, half the tomato paste, half the Tuscan seasoning and reserved cooking water and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to medium and cook for 5 mins or until slightly thickened.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2919300/photos/large/65511_3-74ee6aae1465017365bdb77fcc6b6960.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Finish sauce: Crumble half the feta into the sauce and stir until melted and combined. Add the spinach (see Make it yours) and stir until wilted. Add the ravioli and gently toss to combine. Remove the pan from the heat. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2919301/photos/large/65511_4-fe967435a819129b7e13c8defa68159e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the ravioli and sauce among bowls and crumble over the remaining feta. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2919302/photos/large/65511_5-1eb8cf7dba8c19b9d601da6faeb823a3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Instead of stirring the spinach into the sauce, why not serve the leaves on the side? Dress with olive oil and your favourite vinegar, if you like.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2919303/photos/large/65511_6-eed868b49222c32391a5857b2c665031.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
